<!-- Campaign event template for standard USN-style "daily intentions message" (DIM) - formatting taken from real world examples -->

<ScrollViewer xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
  xmlns:local="clr-namespace:SeapowerUI">

	<Border HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Width="900" TextElement.FontFamily="Courier New" TextElement.Foreground="Black" TextElement.FontSize="16" Padding="45">
		<Border.Effect>
			<DropShadowEffect />
		</Border.Effect>
		<Border.Background>
			<ImageBrush ImageSource="{Binding Assets[bkg_paper]}" Stretch="UniformToFill"/>
		</Border.Background>
		
        <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical">

		<Grid
		  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
		  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml" >
		<Grid.RowDefinitions>
			<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
		</Grid.RowDefinitions>
			<Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="3*"/>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
			</Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
			
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Text="NAVAL MESSAGE" Margin="0" FontFamily="Arial Narrow Bold" FontSize="26" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Left"/>
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Text="*******S E C R E T*******" Margin="40,0,40,0" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Center"/>
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" Text="NAVY DEPARTMENT" Margin="0" FontFamily="Arial Narrow Bold" FontSize="26" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Right"/>
			
		</Grid>
		
		<Rectangle HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Height="1" Fill="Black" Margin="0,0,0,1"/>
		<Rectangle HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Height="1" Fill="Black" Margin="0,0,0,10"/>

			<Grid
			  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
			  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
			<Grid.RowDefinitions>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="10"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
				</Grid.RowDefinitions>
				<Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
				</Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="16">
					IMMEDIATE
					<LineBreak/>
					O 08 0200Z MAR 88
				</TextBlock>
				
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="3" FontSize="16" Text="ZYUW RUHGOAA0777 0808100"/>


				<TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="FM"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="TO"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16">
					<Run Text="COMMANDER"/>
					<Run Text="{Binding DataSource.PersistentData[PlayerTaskForceName], Converter={StaticResource UppercaseConverter}}"/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="11" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="INFO"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="11" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="10th OPERATIONAL SQN"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="12" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="11th OPERATIONAL SQN"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="13" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="10th SUBMARINE DIV"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="14" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="SUBJ"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="14" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="DAILY SITREP"/>

				<TextBlock Grid.Row="15" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="16" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					<LineBreak/>
					SECRET
					<LineBreak/>
					BT
					<LineBreak/>
					<LineBreak/>
					1. (S) SUMMARY: SF Klyuchevskaya and SF Narod alongside Sasebo. Guam heavily reinforced with carrier aviation from KITTY HAWK. CONSTELLATION CVBG probably enroute to Guam, ETA next 4 days. If CONSTELLATION reaches Guam, the combined airpower of a USN CVBG and reinforced USAF airbase will enable US to conduct bombing raids against Japan with impunity. 
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="16" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					2. (S) ENEMY STATUS:
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="17" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,0">	
					- CONSTELLATION located 300nm West of Hawaii at 06 2343Z MAR 88. Her escort group includes at least 2x CG, 2x DD, and 3+ of the new Oliver Hazard Perry long-hull derivative. Her course and speed indicate she will enter Guam air cover in 4 days. 
					<LineBreak/>
					- KITTY HAWK located 500nm East of Hawaii at 07 0015Z MAR 88, appears to be transiting to San Diego. National techical means suggest this carrier is transferring to US mainland for extensive repairs.
					<LineBreak/>
					- Okinawa and Iwo Jima suppressed by VVS Long Range Aviation yesterday. Airfields on both neutralized. Expect no enemy air activity from these locations. 
					<LineBreak/>
					- Guam reinforced with HAWK batteries from Western Europe. HUMINT reports 3+ squadrons of carrier aircraft, likely from KITTY HAWK, landed there 20 hours ago.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="18" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					3. (S) FRIENDLY STATUS:
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="19" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,0">
					- SF Klyuchevskaya along with Northern Fleet reinforcements, will sortie in next 24 hours against CONSTELLATION CVBG. 
					<LineBreak/>
					- 143rd Maritime Missile Aviation Division remains on high alert. Entire division has been rebased to Japan in support of SF Klyuchevskaya's upcoming sortie. 
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="20" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					4. (S) ALLIED / REGIONAL STATUS: Army preparing landings against Okinawa and Iwo Jima in preparation for air campaign against Guam. 
					<LineBreak/>
					VVS Long Range Aviation on reduced op tempo in preparation for air campaign against Guam.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="21" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					5. (S) COMMANDER'S COMMENTS: US 7th Fleet only has one carrier left on hand. When we sink CONSTELLATION, the US will be forced to come to the table. The end of the war is in sight. KTOF sends.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="25" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					SIGNED: Khvatov
					<LineBreak/>
					KTOF
					<LineBreak/>
					<LineBreak/>
					BT
					<LineBreak/>
					SECRET DECL OADR
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
			</Grid>
        </StackPanel>
    </Border>
</ScrollViewer>
